<html lang='en' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <meta http-equiv='X-UA-Compatible' content='IE=edge' />
    <title>Goodbye from Hobbly</title>
    <style>
      @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;600&family=Nunito:wght@400;600&display=swap');
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #fbf6ee;
      }
      a {
        color: inherit;
      }
      @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {
        .email-wrapper {
          padding: 16px !important;
        }
        .email-card {
          padding: 28px 20px !important;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body
    style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#FBF6EE;font-family:'Nunito',Arial,sans-serif;"
  >

    <!-- Outer wrapper -->
    <table
      width='100%'
      cellpadding='0'
      cellspacing='0'
      border='0'
      style='background-color:#FBF6EE;'
    >
      <tr>
        <td align='center' class='email-wrapper' style='padding:40px 16px;'>

          <!-- Email card -->
          <table
            width='100%'
            cellpadding='0'
            cellspacing='0'
            border='0'
            style='max-width:560px;'
          >

            <!-- ── HEADER ── -->
            <tr>
              <td
                style='background-color:#1C2B3A;border-radius:20px 20px 0 0;padding:28px 36px 24px;text-align:center;'
              >
                <p
                  style="margin:0 0 4px;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:#FBF6EE;letter-spacing:-0.3px;"
                >
                  ✨ Hobbly
                </p>
                <p
                  style="margin:0;font-family:'Nunito',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#A8BCCF;letter-spacing:0.2px;"
                >
                  A cozy place for everything you love
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- ── FAREWELL HERO ── -->
            <tr>
              <td
                style='background:white;padding:36px 40px 0px;border-left:1px solid #EDE8DF;border-right:1px solid #EDE8DF;text-align:center;'
              >
                <p style='margin:0 0 16px;font-size:56px;line-height:1;'>🌙</p>
                <h1
                  style="margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;color:#1C2B3A;line-height:1.25;"
                >
                  Until we meet again,
                  {{username}}
                </h1>
                <p
                  style="margin:0;font-family:'Nunito',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#4A5568;line-height:1.6;"
                >
                  Your Hobbly account has been permanently deleted.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- ── BODY ── -->
            <tr>
              <td
                class='email-card'
                style='background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:32px 40px;border-left:1px solid #EDE8DF;border-right:1px solid #EDE8DF;'
              >

                <!-- Personal note -->
                <p
                  style="margin:0 0 28px;font-family:'Nunito',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#3A4A5C;line-height:1.8;"
                >
                  We're sad to see you go. Every entry you logged, every hobby
                  you tracked, every quiet moment you captured — those memories
                  were yours. We hope Hobbly gave you a little cozy corner to
                  call your own, even for a while. 🌸
                </p>

                <!-- Divider -->
                <table
                  width='100%'
                  cellpadding='0'
                  cellspacing='0'
                  border='0'
                  style='margin-bottom:28px;'
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td
                      style='border-top:1px solid #EDE8DF;font-size:0;line-height:0;'
                    >&nbsp;</td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <!-- What happened to your data -->
                <p
                  style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#1C2B3A;"
                >
                  What happened to your data
                </p>

                <table
                  width='100%'
                  cellpadding='0'
                  cellspacing='0'
                  border='0'
                  style='padding:4px;margin-bottom:28px;'
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td style='padding-bottom:14px;'>
                      <table cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' border='0'>
                        <tr>
                          <td
                            style='width:32px;vertical-align:top;padding-top:1px;font-size:20px;'
                          >🗑️</td>
                          <td
                            style="font-family:'Nunito',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#4A5568;line-height:1.5;"
                          >
                            Your profile, entries, and hobby logs have been
                            removed from Hobbly.
                          </td>
                        </tr>
                      </table>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td style='padding-bottom:14px;'>
                      <table cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' border='0'>
                        <tr>
                          <td
                            style='width:32px;vertical-align:top;padding-top:1px;font-size:20px;'
                          >🔒</td>
                          <td
                            style="font-family:'Nunito',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#4A5568;line-height:1.5;"
                          >
                            Your personal data will be fully purged from our
                            servers within 6 hours.
                          </td>
                        </tr>
                      </table>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td>
                      <table cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' border='0'>
                        <tr>
                          <td
                            style='width:32px;vertical-align:top;padding-top:1px;font-size:20px;'
                          >🌐</td>
                          <td
                            style="font-family:'Nunito',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#4A5568;line-height:1.5;"
                          >

                            Any public entries you shared are no longer visible
                            to the community.
                          </td>
                        </tr>
                      </table>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <!-- Deletion record -->
                <table
                  width='100%'
                  cellpadding='0'
                  cellspacing='0'
                  border='0'
                  style='background-color:#FBF6EE;border:1px solid #EDE0CC;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:28px;'
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td style='padding:14px 18px;'>
                      <table cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' border='0'>
                        <tr>
                          <td
                            style='width:28px;vertical-align:top;font-size:18px;padding-top:2px;'
                          >📋</td>
                          <td
                            style="font-family:'Nunito',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#7A6A50;line-height:1.6;"
                          >
                            <strong
                              style='display:block;font-size:11px;color:#6B5A3A;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:3px;'
                            >Deletion record</strong>
                            Account
                            <strong>{{email}}</strong>
                            was deleted on
                            <strong>{{deletedAt}}</strong>. This action is
                            permanent and cannot be reversed.
                          </td>
                        </tr>
                      </table>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <!-- Closing -->
                <p
                  style="margin:0 0 24px;font-family:'Nunito',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#3A4A5C;line-height:1.8;"
                >
                  We hope you carry the joy of your hobbies with you — wherever
                  your next adventure takes you. If you ever want to come back
                  and start fresh, you're always welcome. ✨
                </p>
                <p
                  style="margin:0;font-family:'Nunito',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#3A4A5C;line-height:1.8;"
                >
                  With warmth,<br />
                  <span
                    style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;color:#5BB3D0;"
                  >The Hobbly Team</span>
                </p>

              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- ── FOOTER ── -->
            <tr>
              <td
                style='background-color:#F0EBE1;border-radius:0 0 20px 20px;padding:24px 36px;text-align:center;border-left:1px solid #EDE8DF;border-right:1px solid #EDE8DF;border-bottom:1px solid #EDE8DF;'
              >
                <p
                  style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:'Nunito',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#8A9AAA;line-height:1.6;"
                >
                  This email was sent to
                  <strong>{{email}}</strong>
                  because your Hobbly account was recently deleted.<br />
                  Questions? Contact us at
                  <a
                    href='mailto:support@hobbly.app'
                    style='color:#5BB3D0;text-decoration:none;'
                  >support@hobbly.app</a>
                </p>
                <p
                  style="margin:8px 0 0;font-family:'Nunito',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#B0BEC5;"
                >
                  ©
                  {{year}}
                  Hobbly · Made with ✨ for hobby lovers
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

          </table>
          <!-- /Email card -->

        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>

  </body>
</html>